{
  "title": "Jazzy Jamaican Chickpea Curry",
  "description": "A nutty and crispy Jamaican dish featuring parmigiano-reggiano, this curry is a cozy and delicious meal option, cooked to perfection in an agave leaf vessel and made with ayurvedic-rajasic friendly ingredients.",
